    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stardream</strong> is an <strong>immersive narrative game</strong> set in a retro-futuristic universe inspired by the 60s. <br>You play as a taxi driver on a <strong>space ark</strong>, but everything changes the day a <strong>mysterious message</strong> from outside the space station dome disrupts your routine, pushing you to uncover buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.poster.avif?t=1753982236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.webm?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.mp4?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most objects in the environment are interactive. Open drawers, search furniture, examine documents, and investigate everyday items to <strong>uncover clues</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.poster.avif?t=1753982236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.webm?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.mp4?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dialogue &amp; Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you say matters. Conversations with passengers and residents influence relationships, reveal <strong>hidden truths</strong>, and <strong>branch the story</strong> in meaningful ways. <br>Once the station\u2019s secret is uncovered, prepare for tough ethical decisions. Which path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.poster.avif?t=1753982236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.webm?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.mp4?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving &amp; Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving in <i>Stardream</i> lets you explore the station and decide the order of your <strong>investigation</strong>. Depending on where you choose to go, you trigger <strong>different choices</strong> that affect the story, unlock new leads, and shape your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.poster.avif?t=1753982236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.webm?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.mp4?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Travel through diverse, richly detailed environments aboard your space taxi, visiting iconic station locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Storytelling:</strong> Make impactful decisions through rich dialogues and complex characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic World:</strong> Dive into a unique blend of 60s design and futuristic technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries to Uncover:</strong> A mysterious external message sets you on a gripping quest full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a richly crafted world, diverse gameplay, and a gripping story where every choice shapes your fate.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stardream</strong> is an <strong>immersive narrative game</strong> set in a retro-futuristic universe inspired by the 60s. <br>You play as a taxi driver on a <strong>space ark</strong>, but everything changes the day a <strong>mysterious message</strong> from outside the space station dome disrupts your routine, pushing you to uncover buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.poster.avif?t=1753982236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.webm?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.mp4?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most objects in the environment are interactive. Open drawers, search furniture, examine documents, and investigate everyday items to <strong>uncover clues</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.poster.avif?t=1753982236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.webm?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.mp4?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dialogue &amp; Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you say matters. Conversations with passengers and residents influence relationships, reveal <strong>hidden truths</strong>, and <strong>branch the story</strong> in meaningful ways. <br>Once the station\u2019s secret is uncovered, prepare for tough ethical decisions. Which path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.poster.avif?t=1753982236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.webm?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.mp4?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving &amp; Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving in <i>Stardream</i> lets you explore the station and decide the order of your <strong>investigation</strong>. Depending on where you choose to go, you trigger <strong>different choices</strong> that affect the story, unlock new leads, and shape your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.poster.avif?t=1753982236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.webm?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.mp4?t=1753982236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Travel through diverse, richly detailed environments aboard your space taxi, visiting iconic station locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Storytelling:</strong> Make impactful decisions through rich dialogues and complex characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic World:</strong> Dive into a unique blend of 60s design and futuristic technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries to Uncover:</strong> A mysterious external message sets you on a gripping quest full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a richly crafted world, diverse gameplay, and a gripping story where every choice shapes your fate.</p>",
